WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:03.862
Here's how to book a group class in the Fitdog Owner Portal.

00:00:05.450 --> 00:00:08.186
First, tap your dog, then tap Book.

00:00:09.150 --> 00:00:13.830
Choose Other. That is where group classes and sports sign-ups live.

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:18.272
Pick the class you want. You can choose a group training class, or sports sign-ups.

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.424
In this example, we open Sports Sign Ups, then Adventure Hike.

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:24.472
Tap the date for your class.

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:28.800
Choose a van, then tap a time.

00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.472
Tap Options.

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:42.696
Tell us how your dog is getting there. Check Owner Drop Off at Fitdog Club, and Owner Pick Up at Fitdog Club. Use Fitdog to Pick Up at Home if you need the van.

00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:47.272
Add any notes for the team, then tap Review.

00:00:55.400 --> 00:00:58.832
Look over the details, then tap Submit Request.

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:08.128
You're all set. Fitdog will review the request and confirm. Thanks for booking with Fitdog.
